cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use SafeAgent in your research, please cite this software."

type: software

title: "SafeAgent: A Research Framework for Reliable and Risk-Aware AI Agent Execution"

authors:
  - family-names: Kantimahanti
    given-names: Venkata Siva Gowri Naresh
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-0230-3515"

repository-code: "https://github.com/vkantimahanti/safeagent"

abstract: >-
  SafeAgent is an open-source research project investigating reliable
  and risk-aware recovery mechanisms for AI agents operating in
  state-changing enterprise workflows. The project evaluates
  idempotency, uncertain execution outcomes, recovery strategies,
  and operational safety using reproducible experiments.

keywords:
  - Artificial Intelligence
  - AI Agents
  - Agent Reliability
  - Distributed Systems
  - Idempotency
  - Fault Tolerance
  - LLMOps
  - Enterprise AI